(7449812, 1178933, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love the processing on this and would score it higher in a challenge that was more processing focused than a wide angle challenge.  I''d give this a 7 or more in expert but I want to knock it as a wide angle shot.  My inability to decide has me casting no vote at all (which only does a nicely processed photo a favor here).  But I do really like it.  PM me if I''ve confused or annoyed you - that''s not my intent.</td>', 'I love the processing on this and would score it higher in a challenge that was more processing focused than a wide angle challenge.  I''d give this a 7 or more in expert but I want to knock it as a wide angle shot.  My inability to decide has me casting no vote at all (which only does a nicely processed photo a favor here).  But I do really like it.  PM me if I''ve confused or annoyed you - that''s not my intent.', '2016-04-12 17:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7449813, 1178993, 156466, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to let the lean in the perspective bother me, but it really, really is. Any straight vertical would make me love this - it''s a great capture.  But as is it just looks like a near miss.</td>', 'I don''t want to let the lean in the perspective bother me, but it really, really is. Any straight vertical would make me love this - it''s a great capture.  But as is it just looks like a near miss.', '2016-04-12 17:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7449815, 1178917, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry and perspective. Not crazy about the processing - makes me feel like I''m looking through gradient sunglasses. That said, with the available light I''m at a loss to tell you what I might have done differently.</td>', 'Great symmetry and perspective. Not crazy about the processing - makes me feel like I''m looking through gradient sunglasses. That said, with the available light I''m at a loss to tell you what I might have done differently.', '2016-04-12 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7449818, 1178998, 156466, '<td valign="top">I almost love this.  It''s a great set up, but the desk is lost in the windows. This could/would easily be my blue if you changed the camera position (without being there I can''t tell you where).  As is it''s an "almost" shot for me.  6 as is, but this has 9 or 10 potential.</td>', 'I almost love this.  It''s a great set up, but the desk is lost in the windows. This could/would easily be my blue if you changed the camera position (without being there I can''t tell you where).  As is it''s an "almost" shot for me.  6 as is, but this has 9 or 10 potential.', '2016-04-12 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7449820, 1179015, 156466, '<td valign="top">there''s almost too much perspective correction here for me to look at it and say, "Ooooh, nice wide angle shot".  Still in my top 3 so far.<br/> <br/>OK, bumping - my choice for blue.</td>', 'there''s almost too much perspective correction here for me to look at it and say, "Ooooh, nice wide angle shot".  Still in my top 3 so far. OK, bumping - my choice for blue.', '2016-04-12 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
